### ADMIN_SECRET_KEY
@admin = {{$dotenv ADMIN_SECRET}}

### State (as projector, no auth)
GET {{base}}/api/state

### Join
POST {{base}}/api/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "Lars" }

### State (as player)
GET {{base}}/api/state
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### State (as projector, no auth)
GET {{base}}/api/state

### Bet — copy round.id from the state response
POST {{base}}/api/bet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roundId": "PASTE_ROUND_ID", "side": "A", "stake": 20 }

### Inject — ONE clue per player per round, during OPENINGS or DEBATE, max 200 chars (side = your bet)
POST {{base}}/api/inject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roundId": "PASTE_ROUND_ID", "text": "Point out the muddy footprints." }

### Reset (fresh game, everyone back to 100)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/reset
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

### Start round 1 (→ REVEAL)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/start
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

### Advance — change expectedPhase each time:
### REVEAL → BETTING → OPENINGS → DEBATE → JUDGING → RESULTS → (next round)
### OPENINGS needs both openings done, JUDGING needs the verdict: use "Run next AI step" below until status is "done".
### DEBATE can be advanced any time (the judge rules on the turns that exist).
POST {{base}}/api/admin/advance
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedPhase": "REVEAL" }

### Autopilot step (call repeatedly instead of advance) — or run: npx tsx --env-file=.env scripts/dev/autopilot.ts
POST {{base}}/api/admin/tick
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

### Run next AI step / retry a failed one (one model call: next opening, next turn, or the judge)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/run-ai
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roundId": "PASTE_ROUND_ID", "expectedPhase": "OPENINGS" }

### Cancel + refund
POST {{base}}/api/admin/cancel
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roundId": "PASTE_ROUND_ID" }